    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "79 Sutton Grove is a three-bedroom end-of-terrace family home situated in a quiet cul-de-sac within this highly sought-after and exceptionally convenient location.\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an excellent position backing directly onto a large park, providing a pleasant open outlook and a high degree of privacy. Bayside DART Station is approximately a two-minute walk across the park, while the shops and everyday amenities at Bayside Square are also within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been extended at ground-floor level to the rear and also benefits from a small entrance porch. A particularly notable feature is the garage located within the adjoining compound. The garage is positioned against the rear garden boundary wall, offering the potential to create direct access from the garden and significantly enhance its practical use.\r\n\r\nThe ground-floor accommodation comprises an entrance porch, inner hallway, living room with a door leading through to an extended family and dining room, and a separate kitchen. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nWhile the property would benefit from some general modernisation, it offers considerable potential in an excellent location. The quiet cul-de-sac setting, parkland outlook, nearby transport links and convenient access to local amenities make this an appealing opportunity for families, first-time buyers and purchasers seeking a home they can improve over time."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "First floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n1.70 x 3.90m\r\nUnder stair storage space\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n3.85 x 5.85m\r\nOpen fireplace, feature floor to ceiling windows. Door through to\r\n\r\nExtended Family / Dining Room\r\n6.95 x 3.30m\r\nGround floor extension to rear\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n3.45 x 2.40m\r\nRange of fitted floor and wall mounted presses.\r\nGlazed door to rear garden\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.50 x 1.90m\r\nWC & WHB, cubicle shower, bath\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.00 x 2.90m\r\nFeature full width window overlooking rear garden, access to attic storage.\r\nBuilt-in storage closet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.25 x 3.85m\r\nFeature full width window overlooking front garden\r\nBuilt-in storage closet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.80 x 2.50m\r\nOverlooking front garden"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Quiet cul-de-sac location\r\n- Very settled and mature location\r\n- Not overlooked front or rear\r\n- Rear overlooks a large park area adjacent to Bayside DART Station\r\n- Walking distance to bus, DART, shopping centre, sports facilities, schools and seafront\r\n- Garage located to the side with potential for direct access from the rear garden"
